{"name": "Disinherited", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your father descended into the catacombs to kill Death and claim eternal life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He failed, and cut you out of his will, leaving everything to his cat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your revenge? Succeeding on your Father's quest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935710/extras_big/ec13bf6d3a24f9f933ce23d54257e802.webp?t=1780512855\" height=\"192\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935710/extras/ec13bf6d3a24f9f933ce23d54257e802.avif?t=1780512855\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"426\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935710/extras/824613748328f6e562498f38c36c1e41.poster.avif?t=1780512855\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935710/extras/824613748328f6e562498f38c36c1e41.webm?t=1780512855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935710/extras/824613748328f6e562498f38c36c1e41.mp4?t=1780512855\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>CATCH, THROW, AND PARRY</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Samuel's magical cane is weak. But by turning your opponent's attacks against them, you can outwit and conquer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935710/extras_big/b68681a1504481d39ccf6e62e8dc06e7.webp?t=1780512855\" height=\"192\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.stea